      "name": "PRODUCED_ARTIFACT_CONSUMED_AS_INPUT",
      "definition": "A subsequent execution step reads or operates on an artifact generated by an earlier execution step, using that earlier artifact as its input for further processing.",
      "source_description": "An artifact (e.g., a generated file or data structure) produced by an earlier execution step.",
      "target_description": "A later execution step that consumes that earlier-produced artifact as input."
